  "description": "Count the number of battleships on a 2D board where ships are placed horizontally or vertically.",
  "target": 2,
  "pseudocode": "count = 0\nfor r = 0 to rows-1:\n  for c = 0 to cols-1:\n    if board[r][c] == 'X':\n      if (r > 0 and board[r-1][c] == 'X') or (c > 0 and board[r][c-1] == 'X'):\n        continue\n      count += 1\nreturn count",
